  "description": "Positioned at the top end of a quiet complex, this secure two bedroom unit delivers the perfect balance of privacy and inner city convenience. Tree lined streets soften the energy of Beaufort Street, yet cafés, restaurants, and everything you need remain just moments from your door.<br/><br/>Inside, a modern kitchen with gas cooking, generous bench space and ample storage flows seamlessly into an open-plan living and dining area. Step out onto the private balcony and enjoy your morning coffee above the tree canopy - a genuinely peaceful perch in the heart of the city. Two well sized bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, while a modern tiled bathroom with integrated laundry keeps everyday practicalities neatly contained.<br/><br/>Positioned just 8 minutes from the Perth CBD, this home offers an unbeatable inner-city lifestyle close to everything. It's within walking distance to the Beaufort Street café and dining strip, with easy access to the Mitchell Freeway and nearby train stations for effortless commuting. Perfectly placed between the Mount Lawley and Inglewood village precincts, it sits in one of Perth's most vibrant lifestyle pockets, and is zoned for both Mount Lawley Primary School and Mount Lawley Senior High School.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/><br/>Living<br/>-Open-plan living, kitchen and dining area opeing onto balcony<br/>-Modern kitchen with gas cooking and ample storage<br/>-Two well sized bedrooms<br/>-Modern tiled bathroom with integrated laundry<br/><br/>Key Features<br/>-End unit position with one common wall only<br/>-Top floor apartment<br/>-AC to kitchen, living and dining<br/><br/>Exterior<br/>-Private balcony with peaceful, leafy outlook<br/>-Well maintained complex<br/><br/>Parking and Storage<br/>-One undercover allocated parking bay<br/><br/>HOW TO VIEW THIS PROPERTY<br/><br/>Arranging an inspection is easy!<br/>Simply scroll down to where it says 'Request a time', you can then choose an inspection time that suits you. An instant registration email will be sent to you. Confirm your attendance by selecting 'register'. If this time does not suit, select 'None of these times suit' and we can notify you of the next available time to view, should there be one.<br/>PLEASE NOTE: If you do not register to attend we can't notify you of any changes or cancellations to open. An open will be cancelled if no one has registered to attend.<br/><br/>If you cannot attend in person, we recommend sending someone on your behalf. We do not accept applications prior to viewing.<br/>",
